    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10702" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίχθων</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>opposite</i> or
